Package: CorDeflVol
Title: Corneal Deflection Volume (HC Two-Sphere)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("RQ", email = "rq@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compute corneal deflection volume at highest concavity (HC)
    using a two-sphere intersection model. Provides closed-form and
    disk-integration algorithms.
